<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australis half year loss widens.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australis half year loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>:</p>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating			loss 103.65 vs loss 97.50</p>
<p>    Net				loss 141.93 vs loss 97.50</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)			 nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Sales				    55.83 vs 13.27</p>
<p>    Other income			   15.01 vs  8.73</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		     loss 21.0  vs loss 17.3</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		  loss 38.28 vs nil</p>
<p>    Interest				 29.10 vs 17.25</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   39.55 vs 11.59</p>
<p>NOTE - Australis Media Ltd is a satellite pay TV operator. Accumulated losses at end-December A$535.77 million vs A$239.65 million.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
